{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "787a2efcef912a666926fd5f5028cc7647c2cefdc1748642d486c6d9c7e11bfe", "ja": "魅裏怨 -ぷっぷかさん-", "zh": "魅里怨──噗、噗卡小姐", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1fa8b9335c9778f0800524f90864bc19d6cd9f105d3a420a67d55af9fc644844", "ja": "可憐は自分はエクソシストで、学校には潜入\n捜査でやってきたと可奈達に打ち明ける。し\nかし、護符もお香も無力化する強力な霊に、\n困惑しているとのこと。そしていよいよ……\nぷっぷかさんが覚醒してしまう！", "zh": "可怜向可奈等人坦言自己是位驱魔师，\n是为了进行调查才会潜入学校。\n但面对足以让护身符和香都失效的强大幽灵，\n令她感到不知所措。\n而噗、噗卡小姐她……终于要觉醒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "24b2eefba503771ee264302bda8f066674660ee3098f6d1a222d8a8cd2736486", "ja": "はやく美奈子さんを助けに行かなきゃ！\n悪霊退散～！　ぷっぷかさん～！！", "zh": "必须赶快去救美奈子才行！\n恶灵退散～！噗、噗卡小姐～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "ba0ad3f3f29520879a49fcec70aafeade01e4abac3fbddf461c2ce91cdba4e98", "ja": "矢吹さん、お静かに。\nここはひとまず様子を見るべきです。", "zh": "矢吹同学，请安静点。\n现在应该先暂时观察一下情况。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "4658c6d50e7ee46f18a2ffbf5666665350a25d30a0efbb9dc36bf03fb854b669", "ja": "くんくん……あの、ま、真壁、瑞希さん……\nでした、よね……？　御札、持ってませんか？", "zh": "嗅嗅……那个，你、你是真壁瑞希同学……对吧……？\n你身上有神符吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "a1d3b528437ffcbc3ea442b55eed0d64fe7f0ba53741df203511ce7e1d7b9934", "ja": "持っています、オカルト部なので。ですが篠宮さん。\n私が御札を持っていると、どうしてわかったのですか。", "zh": "有喔，毕竟我可是超自然研究社的成员。\n不过筿宫同学，你怎么会知道我身上有神符呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "a9a08ac1a5266c9bb253ffe6c5c7d5db5cdfe1279c83e9d2f05cb3041ce14ee6", "ja": "私の使うお香とは、違う種類の\n香りがしたので……も、もしかしたらって……。", "zh": "因为有股味道，闻起来跟我使用的香种类不同……\n所、所以我才想说可能是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "3852752ccb35539d810abb10579f44fdf54861e90e84f81f18976f6bd94f3e42", "ja": "お、御札を、ドアの四隅に貼ってください……。\nそれで、しばらく……霊を、閉じ込めますので……。", "zh": "请、请把神符贴在门的四个角落……\n这样子就能暂时……封住幽灵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "0939cd26298a6df52396040013ee5dee89836ed773abf90e237b3835490f30b3", "ja": "あ！　美奈子さんがまだいるのに、\nなんでドアに御札貼るんですか！？", "zh": "啊！美奈子还在里面，\n你们为什么要把神符贴在门上！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "43f1d016c9edd5d740f9d5873fef6cd5cc516b87bfaad33d829e4fc615f37164", "ja": "だ、ダメ……じゃ、邪魔しないで……ください……。", "zh": "不、不行……请、请不要妨碍……我们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "2d25910fca40b7ef37f24fa71b6431a0a9366b56a53e48163b7a641ddbf0e232", "ja": "さっきのポスターなんとかだって、あなたが\nやったくせに！　あっち行け～！　お化け～！", "zh": "明明刚才的骚什么的现象，就是你搞的鬼！\n滚去那边啦～！妖魔鬼怪～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "5c314419980ba917851d9e2526aeabec77f210802167252574a81deae9b60fac", "ja": "ち、違……違います……。\nわ、私……私は、え、エクソシストで……。", "zh": "不、不……不是的……\n我、我……我是驱、驱魔师……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1010_036kan", "source_sha256": "8077c7086108fa988cae11af716763d6e8c78990f237556f7f1cda1fa7714adf", "ja": "いちごソフト？", "zh": "取模师？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "67e581d781ec2f6cfe22b0a155cc1984c0820bb8969a0337fa6617049d4f2315", "ja": "エクソシスト。悪霊を退治する人です。まさか、\n本物と知り合える日が来るなんて。……ドキドキ。", "zh": "是驱魔师，负责驱除恶灵的人。\n没想到竟然有能认识真正驱魔师的一天……（心跳不已）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "6ad56f8cf6532a67c8b5d8e6031c189d328d9d6f8c86e8af11a02115ed429e0a", "ja": "そ、そうです……。ひ、人に、\nすぐ信じてもらえたの……はじめて……。", "zh": "没、没错……我、我还是第一次遇到……\n这么快就愿意相信我的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "1438079ed3e152d6d5e01a9733f998afdecb030e339e06e1dce27eb04ba4b368", "ja": "オカルト部なので。", "zh": "因为我是超自然研究社的成员啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "e463c483c9e7f1215cd4366df8dc198e0b566dd3b320174d4747101d88935035", "ja": "えっ。と、いうことは……\nあなたは、ぷっぷかさんじゃないんですか？", "zh": "咦，也就是说……\n你并不是噗、噗卡小姐吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "23f8799d3498026674d4f8ff4a9c8b6aec8157f7cd30b05fd70c03dbe5c9b0ff", "ja": "は、はい……。私は、ある人から……この学校に\n憑いた、れ、霊への対処を、依頼されたんです……。", "zh": "是、是的……我是受某人所托……\n前来处理依附在这间学校的幽、幽灵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "afa66869fd1b944deedb67a08d340a769e9d4eb4dd84fb7e22924b4d0c9a0352", "ja": "それで……て、転校生という形で……学校に、\n潜入して……捜査をしていたんですけど……。", "zh": "所以……才、才会以转学生的形式……\n潜入这所学校……进行调查……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "7a83af6f8899ada2b397cdd6848202d792d3a61ba028025cf97330dbf083dad8", "ja": "わっ、そうだったんですか！\nごめんなさい！　私、てっきり……。", "zh": "哇，原来是这样啊！对不起！\n我还以为你是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "96b01a85deabb8ed6bcb3b50a80e628ca9f2b7665e27a45e207d8278a61b2d76", "ja": "い、言っても、信じてもらえないことが、\nほとんどなので……。あの、気にしないでください。", "zh": "因、因为就算说了，也几乎不会有人相信……\n那个，请你别放在心上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "de39471184a246830290e59c6a6ede66b1c57a0a38fad8434bb29fdd70eb32ca", "ja": "ということは。\nやはり佐竹さんは、ぷっぷかさんに……。", "zh": "也就是说，\n佐竹同学果然被噗、噗卡小姐给……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "fd423e2925665246c5270506019015241a1f23caa44309eda7e5c4f7c0aa03bc", "ja": "は、はい……。取り憑かれている状態、です……。私の\n用意した……護符や、お香はすべて無力化されて……。", "zh": "没、没错……她正处于被附身的状态……\n我所准备的……护身符和香，全都失去效力了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "50691750e128a97887d2e6573e4bae140e84f8151c302af1b11605e01ff4f81a", "ja": "ぷ、ぷっぷかさんを、引き離そうとしたのですが……。\nな、なんというか、掴みどころのない、強い霊で……。", "zh": "虽、虽然我想从她的身体驱离噗、噗卡小姐……\n但、但该怎么说呢，她是个难以捉摸的强大幽灵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "3f21d00869e4cf1bac49bc52e0da62d56f0ebb5788ac4af437ee603752fd1bba", "ja": "ぷっぷかさんは、この世にまだ未練を残している。\n……そういうことでしょうか。", "zh": "噗、噗卡小姐对于这个世间还有留恋。\n……是这么一回事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1023_045kar", "source_sha256": "135c9b75f3c753542019c0ebaaffa1e374229f6dc8d5d399e5f3f2b8cc07fcc3", "ja": "はい……。でも、それがなんなのか……\nまだ、ち、調査不足で、掴みきれていなくて……。", "zh": "是的……但是关于她留恋的是什么……\n我还调、调查得不够详细，所以没能完全掌握……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1024_se", "source_sha256": "eb19f500e6817ffc7e42ad1b1677326b5abe990ad5c3249238a61708ccbf8726", "ja": "コンコン……コンコン……", "zh": "叩叩……叩叩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1025_045kar", "source_sha256": "c4e841349382137e921fc194ae97be3fae31c722d064fd2c47f1cb4f001f0329", "ja": "……ぷっぷかさんが、目を覚ましたようです。", "zh": "……噗、噗卡小姐似乎醒来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "b9ad3ac00c2fd27919359f59c115955048ef275296c7905bd8da7d881375982b", "ja": "そこに誰かいるの？　もう。音合わせの最中だよ。\n早く戻って、自分の楽器を持って。", "zh": "有人在那里吗？现在已经在进行调音啰。\n赶快回来，拿好自己的乐器。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1027_019min", "source_sha256": "32eb84267523c604b84e06932116b05000de96ea3958e1b78fd1317b87b3c972", "ja": "ねえ、一緒に合奏しましょう？\nねえ。……ねえ……。", "zh": "呐，一起合奏吧？\n呐……呐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1028_048rei", "source_sha256": "32eb84267523c604b84e06932116b05000de96ea3958e1b78fd1317b87b3c972", "ja": "ねえ、一緒に合奏しましょう？\nねえ。……ねえ……。", "zh": "呐，一起合奏吧？\n呐……呐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1029_019min", "source_sha256": "198d3c9518056efad431dd6ac122594cb918e8aef4ae31429cd3c1491f3a484b", "ja": "ねえ！！", "zh": "呐！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0100_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0100_story_05_1030_048rei", "source_sha256": "198d3c9518056efad431dd6ac122594cb918e8aef4ae31429cd3c1491f3a484b", "ja": "ねえ！！", "zh": "呐！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
